  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The velocity-time graph of a body moving in a&nbsp;straight line is shown in figure.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" style=\"margin:0in\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5a9d7700-c0b4-4b41-afce-17ae2ab52ac4-9894123.PNG\" style=\"width: 482px; height: 257px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p lang=\"en-US\" style=\"margin:0in\">The ratio of displacement and distance travelled by the body in time&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>&nbsp;is</span></span></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6TB5O",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "g6RQY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ibocp",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VRmk8",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/60c3e34c-a9f6-4d8f-931e-0d0d318fa859-9894123_1.PNG\" style=\"width: 363px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Area of upper rectangles, which will give us magnitude of the area under the velocity-time graph,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p>Area of lower&nbsp;rectangles, which will give us magnitude of the area under the velocity-time graph,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Displacement</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>Distance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the required ratio would be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>48</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
